{"fps": 30, "frames": 1622, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 147, "text": "In seventeen nineteen, Paris got rich on a colony nobody had seen.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 8, "e": 13}, {"w": "seventeen", "f": 13, "e": 32}, {"w": "nineteen,", "f": 32, "e": 51}, {"w": "Paris", "f": 52, "e": 62}, {"w": "got", "f": 63, "e": 70}, {"w": "rich", "f": 71, "e": 80}, {"w": "on", "f": 80, "e": 86}, {"w": "a", "f": 86, "e": 89}, {"w": "colony", "f": 90, "e": 103}, {"w": "nobody", "f": 103, "e": 116}, {"w": "had", "f": 117, "e": 124}, {"w": "seen.", "f": 124, "e": 135}]}, {"a": 147, "b": 278, "text": "Imagine you're on the rue Quincampoix, a narrow street jammed with buyers.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 149, "e": 161}, {"w": "you're", "f": 162, "e": 173}, {"w": "on", "f": 174, "e": 178}, {"w": "the", "f": 178, "e": 184}, {"w": "rue", "f": 185, "e": 191}, {"w": "Quincampoix,", "f": 192, "e": 212}, {"w": "a", "f": 213, "e": 215}, {"w": "narrow", "f": 216, "e": 227}, {"w": "street", "f": 228, "e": 238}, {"w": "jammed", "f": 239, "e": 250}, {"w": "with", "f": 250, "e": 258}, {"w": "buyers.", "f": 259, "e": 271}]}, {"a": 278, "b": 409, "text": "John Law's Mississippi Company sells shares at five hundred livres.", "words": [{"w": "John", "f": 280, "e": 289}, {"w": "Law's", "f": 289, "e": 300}, {"w": "Mississippi", "f": 300, "e": 321}, {"w": "Company", "f": 322, "e": 335}, {"w": "sells", "f": 336, "e": 346}, {"w": "shares", "f": 347, "e": 358}, {"w": "at", "f": 359, "e": 364}, {"w": "five", "f": 364, "e": 373}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 373, "e": 387}, {"w": "livres.", "f": 388, "e": 401}]}, {"a": 409, "b": 480, "text": "Rumor says Louisiana is full of gold.", "words": [{"w": "Rumor", "f": 411, "e": 420}, {"w": "says", "f": 421, "e": 428}, {"w": "Louisiana", "f": 429, "e": 445}, {"w": "is", "f": 445, "e": 450}, {"w": "full", "f": 450, "e": 458}, {"w": "of", "f": 459, "e": 463}, {"w": "gold.", "f": 464, "e": 473}]}, {"a": 480, "b": 566, "text": "Within a year, the same share costs ten thousand.", "words": [{"w": "Within", "f": 482, "e": 493}, {"w": "a", "f": 493, "e": 496}, {"w": "year,", "f": 496, "e": 505}, {"w": "the", "f": 505, "e": 511}, {"w": "same", "f": 512, "e": 519}, {"w": "share", "f": 519, "e": 528}, {"w": "costs", "f": 528, "e": 537}, {"w": "ten", "f": 537, "e": 543}, {"w": "thousand.", "f": 544, "e": 558}]}, {"a": 566, "b": 664, "text": "Even maids get rich. Paris calls them millionaires.", "words": [{"w": "Even", "f": 568, "e": 576}, {"w": "maids", "f": 576, "e": 586}, {"w": "get", "f": 587, "e": 593}, {"w": "rich.", "f": 593, "e": 603}, {"w": "Paris", "f": 604, "e": 614}, {"w": "calls", "f": 614, "e": 624}, {"w": "them", "f": 624, "e": 632}, {"w": "millionaires.", "f": 633, "e": 657}]}, {"a": 664, "b": 722, "text": "So where's all that money coming from?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 666, "e": 669}, {"w": "where's", "f": 670, "e": 679}, {"w": "all", "f": 680, "e": 684}, {"w": "that", "f": 685, "e": 691}, {"w": "money", "f": 691, "e": 698}, {"w": "coming", "f": 699, "e": 707}, {"w": "from?", "f": 708, "e": 715}]}, {"a": 722, "b": 862, "text": "You see, picture a board game where the banker prints cash whenever you run short.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 724, "e": 730}, {"w": "see,", "f": 731, "e": 738}, {"w": "picture", "f": 738, "e": 750}, {"w": "a", "f": 751, "e": 754}, {"w": "board", "f": 754, "e": 763}, {"w": "game", "f": 764, "e": 771}, {"w": "where", "f": 772, "e": 780}, {"w": "the", "f": 781, "e": 787}, {"w": "banker", "f": 787, "e": 798}, {"w": "prints", "f": 798, "e": 809}, {"w": "cash", "f": 809, "e": 817}, {"w": "whenever", "f": 817, "e": 831}, {"w": "you", "f": 831, "e": 837}, {"w": "run", "f": 838, "e": 844}, {"w": "short.", "f": 844, "e": 855}]}, {"a": 862, "b": 982, "text": "That's Law. He also runs the royal bank, whose notes buy the shares.", "words": [{"w": "That's", "f": 864, "e": 875}, {"w": "Law.", "f": 875, "e": 883}, {"w": "He", "f": 883, "e": 888}, {"w": "also", "f": 888, "e": 896}, {"w": "runs", "f": 896, "e": 904}, 